{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_9","type":"agent_message","text":"The logs show three separate failures: the Connect link navigates without the app’s auth header, the authorize URL requests the same scope areas twice, and the server invents a one-hour expiry when Intervals omits `expires_in`. I also found a token exchange request that sends fields Intervals does not expect. I’m fixing the flow end to end and will verify it locally without calling Intervals."}}
